{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00140",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.2,
      "end_seconds": 3.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Afternoon. Take the chair by the desk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.92,
      "end_seconds": 5.62,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 6.25,
      "end_seconds": 10.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.67,
      "end_seconds": 16.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here. Go ahead, tell me what's happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 17.23,
      "end_seconds": 22.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "It's an itchy rash, doctor. She didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.91,
      "end_seconds": 25.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.6,
      "end_seconds": 29.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "I've had it for three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.34,
      "end_seconds": 39.39,
      "duration_seconds": 9.05,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps. It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.05,
      "end_seconds": 56.32,
      "duration_seconds": 16.27,
      "text": "It's worse with sweating and soap. It's every other day. Only moisturiser, and it's not much. It's severe, honestly. I've also had redness. And there's dry, scaly patches as well, two days now. As for dry, scaly patches, mild, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.08,
      "end_seconds": 61.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.71,
      "end_seconds": 62.41,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.61,
      "end_seconds": 77.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Any similar rash in family members?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.5,
      "end_seconds": 81.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "No. No similar rash in family members."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.77,
      "end_seconds": 86.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Any new soap or detergent or oozing at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.48,
      "end_seconds": 90.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "No, no new soap or detergent or oozing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.55,
      "end_seconds": 104.8,
      "duration_seconds": 13.25,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.73,
      "end_seconds": 107.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.08,
      "end_seconds": 110.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 111.68,
      "end_seconds": 120.88,
      "duration_seconds": 9.2,
      "text": "It's Seretide inhaler, twice a day for my asthma, doctor. She is on moisturiser, twice a day, I give it to her."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.68,
      "end_seconds": 124.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.44,
      "end_seconds": 126.27,
      "duration_seconds": 0.83,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.97,
      "end_seconds": 142.58,
      "duration_seconds": 8.61,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.82,
      "end_seconds": 146.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "I have asthma, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.1,
      "end_seconds": 149.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.66,
      "end_seconds": 153.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.26,
      "end_seconds": 159.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.78,
      "end_seconds": 162.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "My sister has thyroid problems."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.97,
      "end_seconds": 169.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.9,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.35,
      "end_seconds": 172.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.46,
      "end_seconds": 178.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.19,
      "end_seconds": 189.73,
      "duration_seconds": 10.54,
      "text": "Yes, uh, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.21,
      "end_seconds": 193.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.14,
      "end_seconds": 204.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.39,
      "end_seconds": 233.57,
      "duration_seconds": 9.18,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 114 over 75, weight 64 kilos, temperature 36.6, heart rate 76, SpO2 97 percent on room air, height 156 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.88,
      "end_seconds": 239.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.77,
      "end_seconds": 242.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Hold your arm out like this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.72,
      "end_seconds": 259.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "There are dry red patches in the creases of both elbows with scratch marks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.46,
      "end_seconds": 285.94,
      "duration_seconds": 22.48,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. Right, here's what I'm thinking. This looks most like an eczema flare-up. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. I'd also keep a fungal infection in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.54,
      "end_seconds": 288.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Doctor, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.75,
      "end_seconds": 306.73,
      "duration_seconds": 16.98,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's an eczema flare-up, and we'll watch how it goes. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had an itchy rash for three weeks, severe, and no oozing or similar rash in family members."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.3,
      "end_seconds": 310.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.05,
      "end_seconds": 314.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Right, do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.92,
      "end_seconds": 329.42,
      "duration_seconds": 13.5,
      "text": "Okay, so yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.4,
      "end_seconds": 354.76,
      "duration_seconds": 24.36,
      "text": "Let's use cetirizine, 10 milligrams, at night, for one week. That should help with itching. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up. Moisturise right after a bath, thick creams are better than lotions, and use a mild soap. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 356.22,
      "end_seconds": 363.63,
      "duration_seconds": 7.41,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 364.91,
      "end_seconds": 367.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Got it, uh, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.2,
      "end_seconds": 371.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Let's review you in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 371.76,
      "end_seconds": 373.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.81,
      "end_seconds": 384.23,
      "duration_seconds": 7.42,
      "text": "Right, just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 384.87,
      "end_seconds": 392.2,
      "duration_seconds": 7.33,
      "text": "So, I take the cetirizine, 10 milligrams, at night and come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 393.03,
      "end_seconds": 398.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we've covered it. Do you have any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 398.77,
      "end_seconds": 401.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "That's all, thank you for your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 402.5,
      "end_seconds": 403.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}